OL,3,GNEWSAHow the Tartan Army could link Ayr
OL,4,Awith an American state
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe past summer saw thousands of
OL,7,FScotland fans head to America to cheer
OL,8,Fon the national team at the World Cup.
OL,10,FWhile Scotland's games were played in
OL,11,FBoston and Miami, many Scots based
OL,12,Fthemselves elsewhere - with about 5,000
OL,13,Fstaying in Providence, Rhode Island.
OL,15,FNow one region could wind up with
OL,16,Fcloser links Stateside as a result.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
