OL,3,GNEWSAHow the Tartan Army could link Ayr
OL,4,Awith an American state
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Ayrshire councillors last week
OL,7,Funanimously backed an application by
OL,8,Fthe Ayr-Providence Friendship
OL,9,FInitiative (APFI) that hopes to set up
OL,10,Fa formal friendship agreement between
OL,11,FAyr and Providence, the state capital
OL,12,Fof America's smallest state.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
